{"id":"n72392-2-9","stage":1,"title":"풍경 · 情景","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72392-2-9-1","ko":"방 안 풍경이 왜 이래?","zh":"房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풍경이","meaning":"情景，景象","explanation":"풍경：情景，景象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"2","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이래?","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"情景，景象","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"能引发情感的风景或状况。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a5aa79078f918a2e86f8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72392-2-9-2","ko":"애들이 어질러 놓아서 그렇지 뭐.","zh":"肯定是孩子们把东西弄乱了呗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애들이","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어질러","meaning":"弄乱","explanation":"어지르다：弄乱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"어지르다","audio":"/audio/4e685d1e935cf690d3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67097","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓아서","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"4e685d1e935cf690","term":"어지르다","zh":"弄乱","audio":"/audio/4e685d1e935cf690d3d5.mp3","entryId":"67097","definition":"将整理好的事情或东西弄混杂。","pronunciation":["어지르다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/63e41e28a9710a3411c2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72392","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.6844,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["肯定是孩子们把东西弄乱了呗。","你问过我们要找的地方在哪儿了吗？","房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["肯定是孩子们把东西弄乱了呗。","房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？","你问过我们要找的地方在哪儿了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
